sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Corporate User
    participant Ingress as Ingress Controller (TLS)
    participant OpenWebUI as OpenWebUI Pod (tenant-acme)
    participant LDAPS as Corporate LDAPS (ldaps.acme.com)
    participant LiteLLM as Local LiteLLM Proxy (tenant-acme:4000)
    participant Upstream as Upstream LLM (OpenAI/Anthropic/Azure)

    Note over User, LDAPS: Phase 1: Authentication
    User->>Ingress: HTTPS GET https://acme.ai.saasdomain.com
    Ingress->>OpenWebUI: HTTP Forward (Host: acme.ai.saasdomain.com:8080)
    OpenWebUI-->>User: Present Login Screen (Corporate AD Theme)
    User->>OpenWebUI: Submit Credentials (user@acme.com / password)
    OpenWebUI->>LDAPS: LDAPS Bind & Search (TCP 636 / TLS)
    LDAPS-->>OpenWebUI: Authentication Success (DN & Groups verified)
    OpenWebUI-->>User: Set Secure HTTP-Only Session Cookie

    Note over User, Upstream: Phase 2: Localized Chat Inference & Governance
    User->>OpenWebUI: POST /api/chat/completions (Prompt: "Analyze balance sheet")
    OpenWebUI->>LiteLLM: HTTP POST http://litellm:4000/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer <tenant-local-key><br/>Payload: {model: "gpt-4o", messages: [...]}
    
    Note over LiteLLM: Evaluate Local Policy & Quotas
    LiteLLM->>LiteLLM: Check In-Memory / SQLite Rate Limits (RPM / TPM)
    alt Rate Limit Exceeded
        LiteLLM-->>OpenWebUI: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests
        OpenWebUI-->>User: Display Rate Limit Warning
    else Rate Limit OK
        LiteLLM->>LiteLLM: Verify Spend < Tenant max_budget
        alt Budget Exceeded
            LiteLLM-->>OpenWebUI: HTTP 400/429 BudgetExceededError
            OpenWebUI-->>User: Display Organization Budget Depleted
        else Budget OK
            LiteLLM->>Upstream: Outbound HTTPS POST (Port 443)<br/>Authorization: Bearer <Tenant-Scoped / BYOK Key>
            Upstream-->>LiteLLM: Stream Tokens (Server-Sent Events)
            LiteLLM->>OpenWebUI: Forward Streamed Tokens
            OpenWebUI-->>User: Render Streamed Markdown Response
            
            Note over LiteLLM: Phase 3: Localized Accounting
            LiteLLM->>LiteLLM: Increment Local Spend Tracking Record
        end
    end
